n            \"Superscript apparatus reference 48 appears between ወ and ሰላም; it is omitted without adding a space.\",\n            \"Superscript apparatus references 49 and 50 are omitted.\",\n            \"The final double Ethiopic stop belongs to this unit; heading XII and its following text are excluded.\"\n          ],\n          \"uncertainties\": [\n            {\n              \"location\": \"Unit 2, third line of the detail image, first glyph of the word between ወርእይ፡ and ይከውን፡.\",\n              \"proposed_reading\": null,\n              \"actual_pixel_observation\": \"A raised central stroke and descending side strokes are visible, but the small features distinguishing the ሰ/ስ forms remain unsettled. The following glyphs are read as ትፋ.\",\n              \"unresolved\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"images_examined\": [\n    \"pdf68-full\",\n    \"chapter11-body-detail\"\n  ],\n  \"incomplete_regions\": [\n    \"The supplied full-page image's apparatus ends at reference 42; the apparatus entries corresponding to chapter XI's references 46–50 are not visible.\"\n  ],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Transcription is based only on the supplied facsimile images, without OCR or an external transcription.\",\n    \"Unsettled glyphs are represented by literal ⟦?⟧ rather than resolved through meaning or apparatus conjecture.\",\n    \"No chapter XI body region is visibly cropped; the missing region concerns its apparatus entries.\"\n  ]\n}",
